    "evidence" => "This commit was first seen in:\n\ncommit 1cb83d4def21494691fa8d9d62a55dcf7fab2b35\nAuthor:     Ethan Meng <rapidcow\@RCs-T480s.local>\nAuthorDate: Tue Jun 9 18:58:14 2026 -0500\nCommit:     Git Daemon <git\@RPi-4B.local>\nCommitDate: Tue Jun 9 18:58:14 2026 -0500\n\n    Receive pack via ssh transport\n    \n    updated:\n      refs/heads/master fd8a213..42d3fdf (+1)\n       1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)\n    \n    Submitted-by: Ethan Meng <rapidcow\@RCs-T480s.local>\n    From: [fd7a:115c:a1e0::ea32:d402]:53728 (RCs-T480s.local.mhfamily.rapidcow.net)\n    Host: [fd7a:115c:a1e0::6e32:6f59]:22 (RPi-4B.river.mhfamily.rapidcow.net)\n\nthen in:\n\ncommit 2def5e01f95cea4070f5569ee97d600c14a5d71f\nAuthor:     Ethan Meng <rapidcow\@RCs-T480s.local>\nAuthorDate: Tue Jun 9 19:10:08 2026 -0500\nCommit:     Git Daemon <git\@RPi-4B.local>\nCommitDate: Tue Jun 9 19:10:08 2026 -0500\n\n    Receive pack via ssh transport\n    \n    updated:\n      refs/heads/master 42d3fdf..12a6a46 (-1+1)\n       1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)\n    \n    Submitted-by: Ethan Meng <rapidcow\@RCs-T480s.local>\n    From: [fd7a:115c:a1e0::ea32:d402]:50520 (RCs-T480s.local.mhfamily.rapidcow.net)\n    Host: [fd7a:115c:a1e0::6e32:6f59]:22 (RPi-4B.river.mhfamily.rapidcow.net)\n\nwith the following changes:\n\nORIG = 42d3fdfddfb06bd31e42fda90f93f954bff0af3d\nHEAD = 12a6a46b29c234b15923c19284f4da7554249125\n 0:  42d3fdf !  0:  12a6a46 xlib/tree-search.pl: reduce \@aref \@bref to scalar\n--- a/42d3fdfddfb06bd31e42fda90f93f954bff0af3d\t2026-06-09 23:57:56.000000000 +0000\n+++ b/12a6a46b29c234b15923c19284f4da7554249125\t2026-06-10 00:04:07.000000000 +0000\n\@\@ -1,8 +1,8 \@\@\n-tree d50d105c04a6ce970eba0306478669f41f59a6bf\n+tree b2b01aa60c80c7c7eb9b27c8e31646be6e73ac7b\n parent fd8a2134973fd4a142b76a53b3be6918ffa68dec\n author Ethan Meng <ethan\@rapidcow.org> 1781049272 -0500\n-committer Ethan Meng <ethan\@rapidcow.org> 1781049476 -0500\n+committer Ethan Meng <ethan\@rapidcow.org> 1781049847 -0500\n \n xlib/tree-search.pl: reduce \@aref \@bref to scalar\n \n By Claude Fable 5:\n\@\@ -14,4 +14,11 \@\@\n truncate them when \@aref really is a prefix of \@atok.\n Seems like it's enough to just truncate everything for\n now, though I will have to look into the mathematical\n soundness of all this....\n+\n+Note regression: dns_strtok is vulnerable in scalar\n+context because reverse in scalar context reverses\n+its arguments string-wise.  I can't find something\n+that enforces list context like \"scalar\" does scalar\n+context (<https://stackoverflow.com/a/17137392>?)\n+so I just threw in a grep while TRUE as passthrough.\n\nthen in:\n\ncommit 204f6ac63f6475aa508055ac6b5bb6d539fc00d7\nAuthor:     Ethan Meng <rapidcow\@RCs-T480s.local>\nAuthorDate: Tue Jun 9 19:30:12 2026 -0500\nCommit:     Git Daemon <git\@RPi-4B.local>\nCommitDate: Tue Jun 9 19:30:13 2026 -0500\n\n    Receive pack via ssh transport\n    \n    updated:\n      refs/heads/master 6cd7006..4af80ef (-3+3)\n       (identical trees)\n    \n    Submitted-by: Ethan Meng <rapidcow\@RCs-T480s.local>\n    From: [fd7a:115c:a1e0::ea32:d402]:41536 (RCs-T480s.local.mhfamily.rapidcow.net)\n    Host: [fd7a:115c:a1e0::6e32:6f59]:22 (RPi-4B.river.mhfamily.rapidcow.net)\n\nwith the following changes:\n\nORIG = 6cd7006582b99ee1574e855ae02af7270c26b3b3\nHEAD = 4af80ef0d8885bca7981aafc100593d417cd5dfb\n 0:  6cd7006 =  0:  4af80ef Move TODO string out of the subtest scope\n 1:  12a6a46 !  1:  358c737 xlib/tree-search.pl: reduce \@aref \@bref to scalar\n--- a/12a6a46b29c234b15923c19284f4da7554249125\t2026-06-10 00:04:07.000000000 +0000\n+++ b/358c737a012cae66df531ca6162015410ae2583b\t2026-06-10 00:04:07.000000000 +0000\n\@\@ -1,10 +1,10 \@\@\n tree b2b01aa60c80c7c7eb9b27c8e31646be6e73ac7b\n-parent fd8a2134973fd4a142b76a53b3be6918ffa68dec\n+parent b666330ee11ced395a62a5132f3286217d886efb\n author Ethan Meng <ethan\@rapidcow.org> 1781049272 -0500\n committer Ethan Meng <ethan\@rapidcow.or