ames (i was too lazy to add them lol...) so i added those\n-in as well.)  nothing crazy-big patch going on!)\n+in as well.)  nothing crazy-big patch going on!\n+\n+  [[ okay, i did sneak in ONE other change in this commit,\n+  as i've noted in this commit note:\n+\n+    +Technically, this patch also addresses the\n+    +case where is the root zone (\".\"); previously\n+    +it said \$p? > 0, where it should have allowed\n+    +0 since \$p? is length minus 1, not length itself.\n+    +\n+    +I'm sure people who operate the root servers\n+    +use something written in a much lower level\n+    +language though... I should have mentioned it\n+    +in the commit message though.  Sorry!\n+\n+  (but then i realized i wanted to fixup something so i'm\n+  just rebasing this while nobody's watching....)\n+  but even then that is IT.  trust me i really tried...\n+  TWO changes isn't that bad, right? :c ]]\n \n (also credit to Claude's critique... (the generated code\n isn't great, but it sure forces me to explain my nonsense\n and, in the process, realize stupid assumptions i've made.)\n\nthen in:\n\ncommit 69c42ad3c3603bb8ffe22d6940414b3c88798b6f\nAuthor:     Ethan Meng <rapidcow\@RCs-T480s.local>\nAuthorDate: Wed Jun 10 18:32:11 2026 -0500\nCommit:     Git Daemon <git\@RPi-4B.local>\nCommitDate: Wed Jun 10 18:32:11 2026 -0500\n\n    Receive pack via ssh transport\n    \n    updated:\n      refs/heads/master 5c74f11..b98bc3a (-126+126)\n       (identical trees)\n      refs/notes/amends 0f64492..8324d85 (+8)\n       5 files changed, 195 insertions(+)\n      refs/notes/commits 4894b6b..f46c694 (+2)\n       4 files changed, 24 insertions(+)\n    \n    Submitted-by: Ethan Meng <rapidcow\@RCs-T480s.local>\n    From: [fd7a:115c:a1e0::ea32:d402]:51266 (RCs-T480s.local.mhfamily.rapidcow.net)\n    Host: [fd7a:115c:a1e0::6e32:6f59]:22 (RPi-4B.river.mhfamily.rapidcow.net)\n\nwith the following changes:\n\nORIG = 5c74f119ea56720fc8c58cf661948a2412f32e28\nHEAD = b98bc3a0b29d64eef584d95a1